      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I spent the month of July 2017 researching efficiency of Solar Power products and the integrity of manufacturers. I looked at many and varied websites. I chose a local supplier who could supply me with my preferred system and also because I am passionate about our small local community and supporting local businesses. I have chosen Suntech 295W panels and Enphase Micro Inverters. I intend to have the racking tilted to 30 degrees to optimise the early morning sun in winter. I intend having 6 of our 16 panels facing due east as we have an ocean view to maximise early morning light. The remaining 10 panels will face due north.",
