      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Solar quotes gave invaluable and useful advice which assisted with the decision making. I did a lot of research. I got several quotes.Lakeside actually came to the house, looked at the roof and access, explained where the envoy could be located.Some other providers quoted for single storey, metal roof even though I had told them/ completed a form stating that it was 2 storey, tile roof. When challenged they requoted much higher. A neighbour warned me this would happen, that a quote would get much larger once they arrived to instal and forms were signed, so it is necessary to read the quotes carefully.Another supplier said I could not have a battery because they aren't available. They are but that company did not have the ability to do it and did not want to tell me that",
